<title>USA: Hallwood Energy holders offered $19.50/shr.</title>
<headline>Hallwood Energy holders offered $19.50/shr.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hallwood Group Inc said it has agreed to offer $19.50 per share for the publicly held 18.4 percent of Hallwood Energy Corp's common.</p>
<p>Hallwood Group said it has entered into a definitive agreement to acquire Hallwood Energy and start an offer for all its common prior to the merger.</p>
<p>Directors of Hallwood Energy have approved the tender offer and the merger, Hallwood Group said.</p>
<p>The company said it owns 81.6 percent of Hallwood Energy's common. Completion of the transaction will be conditioned upon the tendering of at least 90 percent of the stock not held by Hallwood Group, it added. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
